WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.820
Select and copy your Pine Script in TradingView.

00:02.820 --> 00:05.450
Paste it into the OpenChart agent sidebar and ask for a Tea version.

00:05.450 --> 00:07.120
Send the prompt. The agent converts the script.

00:07.120 --> 00:09.400
Open the generated Tea file in Workspace.

00:09.400 --> 00:11.900
Open a Workspace widget beside your chart and choose Add to chart.

00:11.900 --> 00:14.650
The NVDA chart shows the indicator's plots, shades and annotations.
